<title>UK: Postipankki sets $100 million 10-year FRN, call.</title>
<headline>Postipankki sets $100 million 10-year FRN, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   POSTPANKKI</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	*3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    **JUNE.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+25 BP    PAY DATE    23.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.627    FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB	 REOFFER    99.627    SPREAD    3ML +34 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEARS ONE TO FIVE THEN STEPS UP TO 3ML +175 BP</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE FROM YEAR FIVE ON COUPON DATES</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FINLAND   PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	     POSTIPANKKI LTD IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
